OL,3,GNEWSAWhere to watch firework displays
OL,4,Ain Wolverhampton
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will be several Bonfire Night
OL,7,Fevents and firework displays taking
OL,8,Fplace this weekend in Wolverhampton.
OL,10,FCrowds will be able to enjoy live
OL,11,Fmusic, street food and funfairs under
OL,12,Fdry but fresh skies.
OL,14,FHere's a selection of some events
OL,15,Ftaking place in the city.
OL,17,FHundreds of people are expected to
OL,18,Fventure to West Park on Friday for the
OL,19,Fannual firework display and
OL,20,Faccompanying entertainment.
